  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스의 여름 풍경 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스에 여름이 왔다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교에도 아파트에도 거리에도 이름은 알 수 없지만</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">빨강 또는 분홍색을 띤 꽃이 만발했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">한국에서 여름에 보던 백일홍하고 비슷하다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">궁금</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/232ABC4353C32CA330\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-1) 여름꽃-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_232ABC4353C32CA33085F1\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">한낮의 교정에는 뜨거운 태양이 빛을 발하는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그래도 경치를 보고 있으면 마음은 편안해진다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교정의 곳곳에는 이렇게 이곳이 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스주립대</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">임을 알리는 깃발이 가로등에 걸려 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">생각해 보면 미국처럼 각종 깃발이 나부끼는 나라도 흔치 않을 것 같다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">성조기를 비롯해서 텍사스 주기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교 깃발까지</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><!--[endif]--><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2729D34353C32CA533\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-2) 교기-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2729D34353C32CA5338A4F\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">대학교에서도 학생들에게 가정통신문 비슷한 것을 나눠준다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">외국에서 온 학생들이 여름학기를 맞아 학교생활을 잘하고 있는지 알아보기 위해 상담시간을 마련했다는 내용이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시간과 장소가 적혀 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2329214353C32CA634\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-3) 가정통신-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2329214353C32CA63428A0\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2014</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">25</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아침 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분에 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Thorton House</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">로 갔다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">밖에서 바라본 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Thorton House</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">의 여름풍경</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">위에서 말한 여름꽃이 이곳에도 만발해 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">마침 아침에 비가 내렸다가 그치는 바람에 꽃잎이 더욱 선명하다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">새들이 지저귀는 소리도 오늘따라 우렁차다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/222DB04353C32CA72C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-4) Thorton House-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_222DB04353C32CA72C9909\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">상담은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">15</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분 정도 진행되었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">외국인 학생을 담당하는 로사리오 데이비스 여사가 나를 맞아주었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교생활 전반에 관해 이야기를 나눴다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나는 요즘 전공수업을 따라가느라 거의 죽을 노릇이라는 하소연을 늘어놨다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">특히 매일같이 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">페이지 정도의 자료를 읽어야 하는 부담 때문에 잠도 제대로 못 자고 있다고 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">상담을 마치고 나니까 마음이 좀 후련했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그래서 오랜만에 교정의 이곳저곳을 산책삼아 돌아다니는 여유를 누려봤다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">제일 먼저 눈에 들어온 예쁜 집</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. Swinney House</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기가 뭐하는 곳인지를 살펴보니 주차권을 발급해 주는 곳이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/232CF34353C32CA92C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-5) Swinney House-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_232CF34353C32CA92C18AE\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교내 곳곳에서 눈에 띄는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Fraternity</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">와 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Sorority. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">예전에 설명한 바와 같이 미국 대학에는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Honor Society</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 해서 학생들이 전공이나 관심분야 등에 따라 그들만의 사교클럽을 만들어 활동한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">예를 들어 이곳은 델타제타</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24319C4353C32CAA25\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-6) 델타제타-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_24319C4353C32CAA2588D5\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이곳은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1851</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년에 설립되었다는 알파델타파이</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2529D24353C32CAB33\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-7) 알파델타파이-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2529D24353C32CAB331301\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">언뜻 보면 가정집처럼 생긴 이곳은 파이카파프사이</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/265A003D53C32CAE24\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-8) 파이카파프사이-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_265A003D53C32CAE242E22\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학생 하나가 나와서 앉아있는 이곳은 알파타우오메가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2361133D53C32CAF15\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-9) 알파타우오메가-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2361133D53C32CAF15A455\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">한국과 달리 대학주변에 담장이 없다보니 학교와 민간인 거주시설의 경계가 매우 모호하고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">구태여 구분할 필요조차 느끼지 않으니 도시 전체가 대학같은 느낌을 준다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">물론 나는 이런 느낌을 사랑한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">위에서 말한 시설들의 바로 옆에 있는 이곳은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">North Street Studio. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">뭐하는 곳인지는 모르겠지만 예쁘다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2757663D53C32CB029\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-10) North Street Studio-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2757663D53C32CB0297703\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시원한 맥주를 마시고 싶으면 이곳으로 와야 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. Zelicks. Cold Beer</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 써놓은 것을 보면 정말 시원하기는 할 것 같은데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아직은 대낮이라 사람이 없다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2155BC3D53C32CB22D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-11) Zelicks-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2155BC3D53C32CB22D55F7\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기도 뭔지 모르겠다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">간판을 보면 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">antiques, curiosities, frippery, flotsam, junk</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">를 판단다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사전을 찾아보니 골동품</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">호기심</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">값싼 장신구</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">잡동사니</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">쓰레기다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">한마디로 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">만물상</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2667923D53C32CB307\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-12) 만물상-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2667923D53C32CB307961B\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">장례식장</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">분위기는 아늑하다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2266393D53C32CB409\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-13) 장례식장-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2266393D53C32CB4091988\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이렇게 걸어서 제자리로 돌아오면 학교버스타는 곳이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">정류장 맞은편의 교회</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기도 참 예쁘다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">나만 그렇게 느끼는 줄 알았더니 같이 어학원 수업을 듣는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">陳士俊</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이란 중국 친구가 예쁘다고 하면서 저기는 뭐하는 곳이냐고 내게 물었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. UCM. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교 안에 있는 크리스찬들을 위한 교회라고 씌어있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수요일과 일요일 저녁 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시에 예배가 있다고 하니 그 시간에 오면 안에도 들어가 볼 수 있겠다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2355413D53C32CB62F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"57-14) UCM-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2355413D53C32CB62FD58F\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사족</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">:</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1) Honor Society</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">의 입주비용은 기숙사보다 비싸다고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스주립대의 대표적인 기숙사인 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Bobcat Village</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">도 비용이 만만치 않아서 많은 학생들이 학교 주변의 아파트에서 살고 있음을 생각하면</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, Honor Society</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">에는 어떤 부류의 학생들이 살고 있는지 짐작하고도 남음이 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그들은 부자인 부모를 둔 덕분에 저런 곳에 살면서 자기들끼리의 유대관계를 형성해 간다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이들을 보는 나의 마음은</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">배가 아프다기 보다는 솔직히 부럽다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내가 부유한 환경에서 자라서 젊은 나이에 이곳으로 유학을 왔다면 나도 저런 곳에서 살아봤을텐데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">얘네들의 문제는 술을 너무 많이 먹는 것이라고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하긴 집에 돈 있겠다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이들이 무슨 걱정이 있겠는가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">취직 걱정을 할 것도 아니고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그래서 매일 밤마다 파티를 연다고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스주립대 학생들이 파티를 얼마나 좋아하는가 하면 내가 사는 아파트의 맞은편에 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Univrsity Hights</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 대학생들이 모여 사는 아파트가 있는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기 애들도 파티를 엄청 많이 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">초저녁부터 거의 밤 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">12</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시가 될 때까지 풍악을 울리며 노는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">멀리서 바라보고 있으면 그들의 젊음이 부럽다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">매일은 아니고 일주일에 한번은 하는 것 같다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">얘네들은 한겨울에도 날씨만 따뜻하면 수영한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">같은 아파트라고 해도 대학생 거주시설과 일반 가정집은 구조가 다르다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">대학생 거주 아파트는 거실 하나에 방이 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">개 정도 있고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">각 방마다 화장실 겸 욕실이 따로 있는 독립된 형태이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}